OL,5,G1830 How Emily...
OL,6,     FAn uplifting exploration of life
OL,7,     Ffor Emily Nicole Roberts, a
OL,8,     Fwheelchair user with cerebral
OL,9,     Fpalsy. In this episode, Emily
OL,10,     Flooks at the world of beauty and
OL,11,     Ffashion for those with a
OL,12,     Fdisability.
